  "shader_hints": {
    "Planet_shader": "Feed Albedo -> _AlbedoMap with _TextureTint = 1 (the map already carries the biomes; set _Alien = 0 or bypass the procedural land palette), Normal -> _NormalMap, Emission -> _LightsMap with _CityColor ~ (1.6, 1.6, 1.6), Clouds -> _CloudMap. _GlossMap expects sea in .a: use a gloss texture with A = Mask.G, or change the shader to read Mask.r (land) and Mask.g (specular).",
    "relief": "_BumpStrength 1.0-1.5 for the map view, 2 for the cutscene; Height can drive a parallax or a sea-depth tint if wanted.",
    "map_view": "Lit from the camera side: ambient 0.2, emission x0.4 by day so crystal fields still sparkle.",
